@typing character="abigail" duration="3"
@message id="m079" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="I snuck out to the east treeline with my big lens to take pics of owls at night"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m079a" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="I wanted owls. I got nightmares instead"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m079b" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="I had my big lens. I was by the east treeline, near the fence"
@typing character="abigail" duration="3"
@message id="m080" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="And i swear on my life i didnt imagine this"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m080a" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="I did not imagine it. I have it on camera. Sort of"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m080b" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="my hands were shaking so bad the pics are blurry"
@typing character="abigail" duration="3"
@message id="m081" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="Two guys in hazmat gear just wheeled a metal gurney into Sub-Level B. There was someone strapped to it, thrashing so hard the straps were bleeding."
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m081a" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="Two guys in hazmat. Not normal security. Hazmat"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m081b" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="The person on the gurney was screaming. Not crying. Screaming"
@typing character="abigail" duration="3"
@message id="m082" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="And right behind the fence? Something moved in the bushes. Looked like a dog, except totally hairless, huge, with glowing burns down its back."
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m082a" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="It was hairless. Like burned skin. And it was big. Bigger than a dog"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m082b" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="It looked at me. I swear it looked right at my lens"
@typing character="abigail" duration="3"
@message id="m083" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="I hit record for like 4 seconds before my camera screen glitched out from their jammer. Sending u the messed up clip rn!"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m083a" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="4 seconds. That is all I got before the screen glitched"
@comment NEW
@typing character="abigail" duration="2"
@message id="m083b" chat="dm_abigail" sender="abigail" text="the jammer. they have a jammer out there. why would they need a jammer"
